{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "5b1faf5fe99bcf2636b910e5feb0b03f9e3a4145b0d51221dcbfde76658b528c", "ja": "{$P$}、すみません。\n帰りがすっかり遅くなっちゃって……。", "zh": "{$P$}，抱歉。\n把回去的时间拖得这么晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b56eae770f15bc2f5915ff39b5728a21560e6575cfd441879709bdd521099c18", "ja": "いや、こっちこそ付き合わせて悪かったな……。\nカギ、探してくれてありがとう。助かったよ。", "zh": "不，我才要说抱歉呢，还让你陪我找……\n谢谢你帮我找钥匙，帮了我一个大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "ed76266870c8f186f1d46f6ecfd6c3fd0735a583695c52e98e1dd971b2e99084", "ja": "い、いえ！\n元はといえば、私が見間違えたせいですから！", "zh": "不、不会！\n毕竟原因还是出在我看错目标的缘故！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "18bb354bdc16954ad2ab90a34a9ed36472d516426f8195d782014a8c7c0cbe8f", "ja": "変なタイミングで落とした俺も悪かったんだよ。\nそれにしても、ナイスショットだったな！", "zh": "在奇怪的时间点弄掉钥匙的我也有错啦。\n但话又说回来，你打得可真好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "deff2ad503b9959c92b8ee08cc782b9cb37dcf44fd08727f6995b589fa48c234", "ja": "はい、練習しましたから！", "zh": "是，因为我有练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "3382cba5b376ed10270ff6e12e55b205e75b41a6139e30f52efc2d15a7661ff3", "ja": "あっ……でも、打ったのがボールじゃなかったので、\n結局ムダになっちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "啊……不過打到的不是球，\n所以練習還是白費了……<s>", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b3feb60d86e815edb4c5676f11f1d2687bcf982870f600bb9f22a39817fc4d5e", "ja": "いや、優勝はできなかったけど、おいしかった！\nカギがワンオンしたとか、その後の罰ゲームも含めて。", "zh": "不，虽然没拿到优胜，但很有看头喔！\n不管是一杆把钥匙打上果岭，还有之后的惩罚游戏都是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "b33203bbba2c0203145552f187bca06a8c2237ba919e826cdc9f3ed54852a176", "ja": "お、おいしかった……ですか？", "zh": "有、有看头……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "231ce2524bfeb011dd7ad8ff131c1f43e123ee36b0af5ce6118f561a6a4e8b5e", "ja": "ああ、アイドルとしておいしかった。\nだから紗代子の努力は、ムダじゃない。", "zh": "嗯，以偶像来说非常有看头。\n所以纱代子的努力没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "d9196349d4d5ca4021d9f3566a22e6e18999a81f43c2a05c80d71698b91ca3db", "ja": "{$P$}……ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "672fe214739b963593932102f53eb500242088d756407e434af06be39f76b39e", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、すごくホッとしました。\n練習頑張って、よかったです！", "zh": "听到你这么说，让我松了一口气。\n有努力练习真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "b21cb90bee8e62a4c70f4630ab05d9ed732cfcb2f57ff224c0c20fa39d4d024c", "ja": "あっ……でも、他にもありました！\n私にとって、おいしいことです。", "zh": "啊……但是，还不只这样而已！\n对我而言还发生了其他好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f818868e32346b678cb3df96218759598c6585e84cbea720b3a90555e132af6e", "ja": "へぇ、そうなのか？", "zh": "哦，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0033_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b64be38b46b6144adc1ca14497ca61230dd73d5deed638406bffd31e2464a5d9", "ja": "はい！　こうして{$P$}とふたりで、\n一緒に帰れることです……なんて。うふふっ。", "zh": "是的！就是能像这样和{$P$}\n两人一起回去……开玩笑的，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
